@startuml fig4_resources
' Diagram 4 of the VDI 3682 pattern: what performs an operator, and what
' identifies an element.
'
' Conventions: shared/FIGURES.md. Flat boxes, no namespace prefixes, no clause
' numbers, orthogonal edges, nothing explanatory inside the drawing.
'
' What it shows: the assignment tying an operator to the resource performing
' it, and the two ways an element says more about itself.
'
' The assignment is a class rather than an edge, for the same reason the flow
' is: it is a thing a model can annotate. That reification is what the AIAS
' alignment builds on, since aias:assignedFunction starts from this class in
' order to reach a function that is not a process operator.
'
' isAssignedTo runs straight from the operator to the resource, alongside the
' reified path. Both are in the pattern, and a model may state either.
'
' The two attribute relations carry no domain in the pattern: an identification
' and a characteristic attach to any element of a description, not to resources
' alone. The resource stands here as one holder among several, because drawing
' every class that may carry one would say the same thing five times.
'
' Left out on purpose:
'  - process structure: diagram 1
'  - states and flows: diagrams 2 and 3

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam padding 3
skinparam ArrowColor #1A2733
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1A2733
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FCEFC7
  BorderColor #C9A227
  FontColor #1A2733
  FontSize 14
  BorderThickness 1
}

' ===================================================================
'  Who performs what
' ===================================================================

class ProcessOperator
class Assignment
class TechnicalResource

ProcessOperator --> "*" Assignment        : hasAssignment
Assignment      --> "1" TechnicalResource : assignedResource
ProcessOperator --> "*" TechnicalResource : isAssignedTo

' ===================================================================
'  What an element says about itself
' ===================================================================

class Attribute
class Identification {
  dataProp: shortName
  dataProp: longName
  dataProp: uniqueIdent
  dataProp: versionNumber
  dataProp: revisionNumber
  dataProp: externalReference
}
class Characteristic {
  dataProp: category
  dataProp: descriptiveElement
  dataProp: relationalElement
}

Attribute <|-- Identification
Attribute <|-- Characteristic

TechnicalResource --> "1" Identification : isIdentifiedBy
TechnicalResource --> "*" Characteristic : isCharacterizedBy

@enduml
